<title>HONG KONG: Cheung Kong unit, KCRC in property deal.</title>
<headline>Cheung Kong unit, KCRC in property deal.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Kong (Holdings) Ltd said on Thursday an associate company equally owned by it and Hutchison Whampoa Ltd signed a property development agreement with the Kowloon-Canton Railway Corp (KCRC).</p>
<p>The associate and KCRC would jointly develop a residential development with gross floor area of about 110,000 square metres at Hung Shui Kiu in the New Territorties, it said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>It did not elaborate or name the associate.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
